    - target: {fileID: 8881028038475493880, guid: fd28f23af44f73f4a95e33435872ad15, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'You are probably the reason why we are so doomed right now.


        Look
        at you, being teleported to this special education room.


        Have you
        no shame??


        You need to start doing the right thing right now.


        Or
        not. I don''t care. You''re the one who is gonna die anyway.


        Cheers
        babe.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
